# Version control and secrets
.git
tmp
state
docs-personal
AGENTS.md
**/.env

# Python environments and caches; the image installs its own
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Frontend dependencies and build output; the image installs and builds its own
**/node_modules
**/dist

# Side files of a cache that a local server has open. Copied next to cache.sqlite, a journal
# would make SQLite roll back what it takes for an unfinished write.
**/*.sqlite-journal
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/*.sqlite-shm
# A local working copy of the cache; the image ships the committed cache.sqlite only
**/cache.local.sqlite

# OS
**/.DS_Store
